<title>SPAIN: Spain may approve telecom commission on Friday.</title>
<headline>Spain may approve telecom commission on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish cabinet will consider on Friday approving the creation of a commission to oversee free competition in the sector, a spokesman for the Development Ministry.</p>
<p>&quot;The subject of the Telecommunications Market Commission will be taken up by the cabinet tomorrow, and is expected, in principle, to approve it,&quot; the spokesman said.</p>
<p>He gave no further details.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
